{"id":33619,"slug":"not-a-pretty-picture","title":"Not a Pretty Picture","year":1975,"country":"United States","duration":82,"spine":1230,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/33619-not-a-pretty-picture","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/5091b7df0205a80f483a04d7200fccb4/uMY3xLhGXQITT5yDXXMVoVJlB3FBUz_large.jpg","description":"Trailblazing filmmaker Martha Coolidge made her feature debut with this unflinchingly personal hybrid of documentary and fiction. Centered on an intense reenactment of Coolidge’s experience of rape in her adolescence, the film casts Michele Manenti (also a survivor) as the director’s younger self, and observes the actor and her castmates as they engage in a profound dialogue about what it means to recreate these traumatic memories, and about their attitudes concerning consent and self-blame. A high-stakes experiment in metacinema that broke new ground with its uncompromising examination of date rape, Not a Pretty Picture brings a stunning immediacy to questions about the on-screen representation of sexual violence and the limits of artistic catharsis.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Martha Coolidge","slug":"martha-coolidge"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Michele Manenti","role":"Martha at sixteen","slug":"michele-manenti"},{"actor":"Jim Carrington","role":"Curly","slug":"jim-carrington"},{"actor":"Anne Mundstuk","role":"Herself","slug":"anne-mundstuk"},{"actor":"John Fedinatz","role":"West Virginia","slug":"john-fedinatz"},{"actor":"Amy Wright","role":"Cindy","slug":"amy-wright"},{"actor":"Stephen Laurier","role":"Brian","slug":"stephen-laurier"},{"actor":"Hal Studer","role":"Mr. Cullen","slug":"hal-studer"},{"actor":"Janet Morrison","role":"Bunny","slug":"janet-morrison"},{"actor":"Reed Birney","role":"Fred","slug":"reed-birney"},{"actor":"Diana Gold","role":"Jane","slug":"diana-gold"},{"actor":"Lillah McCarthy","role":"Nancy","slug":"lillah-mccarthy"},{"actor":"Melissa Murdock","role":"Leah","slug":"melissa-murd